{
  "key": 50243,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0093_D27R0101_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "People train at this Lighthouse.\r",
        "It’s not easy to climb because of\n",
        "all the Trainers."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0093_D27R0101_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "In the past, Pokémon used to light\n",
        "the sea around Olivine at night.\r",
        "The Lighthouse was made to pay tribute\n",
        "to those Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0093_D27R0101_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, hi! I can make you an awesome\n",
        "necklace if you give me fifteen\f",
        "Poké Balls and one Destiny Knot!\r",
        "How about it?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0093_D27R0101_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "What? Really? I thought that’d be a\n",
        "sure-fire sell!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0093_D27R0101_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Thank you!\r",
        "...But you don’t have the items..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0093_D27R0101_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Thank you!\r",
        "Hold on a moment...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0093_D27R0101_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, crackers, it didn’t work...\r",
        "Uhh... goodbye!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0093_D27R0101_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, hi! I can make you an awesome\n",
        "belt if you give me fifteen Poké Balls\f",
        "and one Destiny Knot!\r",
        "How about it?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0093_D27R0101_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "The woman dropped an item as she\n",
        "was fleeing...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0093_D27R0101_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Volkner: Glitter Lighthouse... It\n",
        "reminds me a lot of Sunyshore City...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0093_D27R0101_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Volkner: Oh, hi. You must be a Trainer\n",
        "from Johto, huh?\r",
        "There’s something about you... You\n",
        "remind me of a Trainer who once\f",
        "recharged my passion for battling.\r",
        "Heh. It’s a shame you aren’t\n",
        "challenging the Sinnoh League.\r",
        "And yet, you’ve somehow cheered me up!\n",
        "Let me give you a gift as thanks.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0093_D27R0101_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Volkner: Thunder Wave is a simple move\n",
        "that will paralyze whatever it can make\f",
        "contact with.\r",
        "I should probably be off.\n",
        "It was a pleasure to meet you!"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
